    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d803">

                <pb facs="0896" n="886" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg886"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Pacific War/3567</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Acting Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-09">November 9,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In regard to the use of Chinese troops against Annam, I agree with the State
                    Department that the French presentation of the case is not sufficiently valid to
                    take any action.</p>
                <pb facs="0897" n="887" xml:id="pg887"/>
                <p>The whole matter should be left to the discretion of the Joint Chiefs of Staff
                    and to the Commanding Officers in the area. This is essentially a military
                    problem.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">rankun</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
